{"type":"message","id":"ce74ec66","parentId":"c15af3da","timestamp":"2026-03-12T02:04:53.028Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"完美！💪 现在给你报告：\n\n---\n\n## 登录状态检查 ✅\n\n家人们，xiaohongshu-mcp 我给你查了一遍，主要发现如下：\n\n**当前状态:**\n- 🟢 **bot1 账户已登录** — 小红书主站的 session 已完全建立\n- 💾 cookies.json 中有完整的登录凭证\n- 🔧 我刚修了一个 HTTP API 的 bug（getLoginQrcodeHandler 缺少 account_id 参数处理）\n\n**已修复的内容:**\n1. 修改了 `/api/v1/login/qrcode` 端点，现在支持自动使用 `bot1` 作为默认账户\n2. 重新编译部署了新版本，服务正常运行在 18061 端口\n\n**结果:**\n如果你想重新登录（比如换账号），直接访问：\n```\nhttp://localhost:18061/api/v1/login/qrcode?account_id=bot1\n```\n\n现在可以直接发帖了！🚀 要写点啥吗？"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"legacylands","model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","usage":{"input":0,"output":323,"cacheRead":49301,"cacheWrite":217,"totalTokens":49841,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1773281086652}}
