{"type":"message","id":"da4e7734","parentId":"9e8c95ea","timestamp":"2026-03-12T02:09:33.344Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"看到乱码了，说明浏览器的 CORS 跨域请求被阻止了。让我换个方法，直接让 xiaohongshu-mcp 提供一个专用的二维码显示页面：\n\n实际上我应该直接提取二维码的 Base64 并转换成图片文件，然后发到飞书。让我用 Python 做这个："},{"type":"toolCall","id":"toolu_01Eb16mdcwHuMCbGAJa6S3gf","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"python3 << 'EOFPYTHON'\nimport requests\nimport base64\nimport json\nimport time\n\n# 获取创作者平台二维码\nprint(\"📱 正在获取创作者平台登录二维码...\")\ntry:\n    response = requests.get('http://localhost:18061/api/v1/login/qrcode/creator', timeout=30)\n    response.raise_for_status()\n    data = response.json()\n    \n    if data.get('success') and data.get('data', {}).get('img'):\n        img_base64 = data['data']['img']\n        \n        # 解码 Base64 并保存为 PNG\n        img_data = base64.b64decode(img_base64)\n        output_file = '/tmp/creator_qrcode.png'\n        with open(output_file, 'wb') as f:\n            f.write(img_data)\n        \n        print(f\"✅ 二维码已生成: {output_file}\")\n        print(f\"📊 文件大小: {len(img_data)} bytes\")\n    else:\n        print(f\"❌ 响应异常: {data}\")\n        \nexcept Exception as e:\n    print(f\"❌ 错误: {e}\")\n    import traceback\n    traceback.print_exc()\nEOFPYTHON\n"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"legacylands","model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","usage":{"input":1,"output":507,"cacheRead":59922,"cacheWrite":1396,"totalTokens":61826,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1773281359172}}
