{"type":"message","id":"5bbe5276","parentId":"c5d066af","timestamp":"2026-03-12T02:12:08.032Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Cookies 已被删除。现在的情况是，我需要通过浏览器扫码登录来获得有效的 cookies。但由于 MCP 服务的浏览器自动化太慢，我改用另一个方法——直接告诉你在 OpenClaw 的浏览器中扫码："},{"type":"toolCall","id":"toolu_012q92NtB3JC4DxNvtPvHGaZ","name":"message","arguments":{"action":"send","target":"user:ou_68cc1fc4093cdcecdb08e73ee053e090","message":"家人们！ 🎯 小红书**创作者平台**的二维码已经准备好了！\n\n📱 **扫码登录链接：**\n```\nhttp://localhost:18061/api/v1/login/qrcode/creator\n```\n\n**👉 步骤很简单：**\n1. 用小红书App（不是浏览器！）\n2. 打开\"我的\"→ \"扫一扫\"\n3. 扫描生成的二维码\n4. 登录后系统会自动保存 session\n\n**⚠️ 温馨提示：**\n- 只能用**小红书App**扫（不能用微信或其他App的扫一扫）\n- 第一次加载二维码可能需要等待 10+ 秒\n- 如果还要扫**主站**的二维码，用这个链接：\n  http://localhost:18061/api/v1/login/qrcode\n\n准备好了吗？💪"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"legacylands","model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","usage":{"input":0,"output":467,"cacheRead":64865,"cacheWrite":156,"totalTokens":65488,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1773281520994}}
