{"type":"message","id":"3e8c7e9e","parentId":"7d0705aa","timestamp":"2026-03-12T02:14:00.633Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"现在发送最终的帮助信息到飞书："},{"type":"toolCall","id":"toolu_01HJntThQL6kX3LSnGeXv2JY","name":"message","arguments":{"action":"send","target":"user:ou_68cc1fc4093cdcecdb08e73ee053e090","message":"📱 **创作者平台扫码登录已准备好！**\n\n我已经修复了 xiaohongshu-mcp 的 HTTP API，现在可以生成创作者平台的登录二维码了。\n\n**✅ 三个可用链接：**\n\n1️⃣ **创作者平台登录**（推荐！）\n   `http://localhost:18061/api/v1/login/qrcode/creator`\n\n2️⃣ **主站登录**\n   `http://localhost:18061/api/v1/login/qrcode`\n\n3️⃣ **登录状态检查**\n   `http://localhost:18061/api/v1/login/status`\n\n**👉 如何扫码：**\n- 用 **小红书 App**（不是浏览器，不是微信）\n- 打开\"我的\"→\"扫一扫\"\n- 扫描二维码完成登录\n\n**💡 后端更新内容：**\n- ✅ 修复 `/api/login/qrcode` 端点（添加 account_id 支持）\n- ✅ 新增 `/api/login/qrcode/creator` 端点（创作者平台专用）\n- ✅ 修复 `/api/login/cookies` 删除端点（account_id 支持）\n- ✅ 重新编译并部署\n\n准备发帖了吗？还是需要先登录创作者平台？💪"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"legacylands","model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","usage":{"input":0,"output":527,"cacheRead":69488,"cacheWrite":567,"totalTokens":70582,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1773281632954}}
{"type":"message","id":"3767496f","parentId":"3e8c7e9e","timestamp":"2026-03-12T02:14:01.401Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"📱 **创作者平台扫码登录已准备好！**\n\n我已经修复了 xiaohongshu-mcp 的 HTTP API，现在可以生成创作者平台的登录二维码了。\n\n**✅ 三个可用链接：**\n\n1️⃣ **创作者平台登录**（推荐！）\n   `http://localhost:18061/api/v1/login/qrcode/creator`\n\n2️⃣ **主站登录**\n   `http://localhost:18061/api/v1/login/qrcode`\n\n3️⃣ **登录状态检查**\n   `http://localhost:18061/api/v1/login/status`\n\n**👉 如何扫码：**\n- 用 **小红书 App**（不是浏览器，不是微信）\n- 打开\"我的\"→\"扫一扫\"\n- 扫描二维码完成登录\n\n**💡 后端更新内容：**\n- ✅ 修复 `/api/login/qrcode` 端点（添加 account_id 支持）\n- ✅ 新增 `/api/login/qrcode/creator` 端点（创作者平台专用）\n- ✅ 修复 `/api/login/cookies` 删除端点（account_id 支持）\n- ✅ 重新编译并部署\n\n准备发帖了吗？还是需要先登录创作者平台？💪"}],"api":"openai-responses","provider":"openclaw","model":"delivery-mirror","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1773281641401}}
